#ASSERT `s 49(6) the delegated function is taken to have been exercised by the delegator` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 49(7) the function may be exercised by the delegate on the opinion, belief or state of mind of the delegate in relation to the matter` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 49(7) the function may be exercised by the delegate on the opinion, belief or state of mind of the delegate in relation to the matter` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 49(7) the function may be exercised by the delegate on the opinion, belief or state of mind of the delegate in relation to the matter` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 49(8)(a) the delegation ceases to have effect merely because the person ceases to be that officer or the holder of that office` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
